-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party code

The files under k*/e1000/ and k*/e1000.orig/ (except e1000_vc.c and
e1000_vc.h) are the FreeBSD e1000/igb driver. They keep their original
copyright notices and licences: Intel Corporation's BSD licence (see
k*/e1000/LICENSE) and the FreeBSD BSD-2-Clause headers in each file.

The prebuilt ichwd.ko is compiled from FreeBSD's unmodified sys/dev/ichwd
(BSD-2-Clause, see the headers in that source).

The VeloCloud register sequences were taken from the velo540openwrt project
(GPL-2.0) as hardware facts; no code from that project is included.
